Package: flake-material-gtk
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Material You inspired GTK3 and GTK4 theme
 flake-material-gtk is a dark GTK theme inspired by Google's Material You
 and Material 3 design languages, with deep container colors and
 expressive active states.
 .
 The package installs the theme to /usr/share/themes/flake-material-gtk,
 including the GTK3 and GTK4 stylesheets and a set of premade color presets.
 GTK4/libadwaita applications only use the theme when its GTK4 stylesheets
 are linked into the user's ~/.config/gtk-4.0 directory; GTK 4.16 or newer
 is required for the GTK4 stylesheet.
